{"seq":3,"slug":"following-nature","title":"Following Nature","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/following-nature","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-dao-and-spontaneity","title":"道与自然","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/following-nature/the-dao-and-spontaneity","wordCount":1670,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"nourishing-life","title":"养生与齐生死","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/following-nature/nourishing-life","wordCount":1804,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现庄子顺应自然的智慧。\"道\"是宇宙万物的本原，而\"自然\"（道法自然）是道的根本特征——人的生活也应顺应自然、不强求不妄为。本章还阐发了庄子的养生智慧（\"庖丁解牛\"顺应自然、游刃有余）与对生死的超越（\"齐生死\"、旷达面对死亡）。本章揭示庄子崇尚自然、顺应自然、旷达生死的深刻智慧。\n"}